# `builtin:kind`

Runs a local Kubernetes cluster with [kind](https://kind.sigs.k8s.io/),
using the host `kind` binary.

```cue
cluster: {
    uses: "builtin:kind"
    with: {
        workers: 1
        egress: ["docker.io", "*.docker.io", "*.docker.com"]
    }
}
```

